Package: FishHist
Type: Package
Title: Southeast Fisheries Management History Data
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(person("Sarina", "Atkinson", , "sarina.atkinson@noaa.gov", role = c("aut", "cre")), person("Gaitlyn", "Malone", role="aut"))
BugReports: https://github.com/SEFSC/FishHist/issues
Description: This package houses code to process fisheries management data
    into an analysis-friendly format where all indivudal regualtions published
    from Federal Registrar (FR) notices are connected. There are also functions
    within this package to analyze and visualize the analysis-friendly 
    management history data.
Imports: ggplot2, dplyr, flextable, lubridate, purrr, stringr, tibble, tidyr, scales
License: GPL-3 + file LICENSE 
Encoding: UTF-8
LazyData: true
Depends: 
    R (>= 3.5)
URL: https://github.com/SEFSC/FishHist
Config/roxygen2/version: 8.1.0
